TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(+3) 4 mmol/kgw
    Fe(+2) 4 mmol/kgw
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -time true
    -kinetic_reactants true
END
